Spec: SpecDD Documentation

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Provide hover documentation for SpecDD section labels.

Structure:
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt: Known section documentation registry.
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.kt: IntelliJ documentation provider.
  /src/main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/sections.txt: Packaged section documentation text.

Owns:
  ./documentation.sdd
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.sdd
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.sdd
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.kt
  /src/main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/sections.txt

Can modify:
  ./documentation.sdd
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.sdd
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.sdd
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.kt
  /src/main/resources/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/sections.txt

Can read:
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/parser/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDFileType.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/*

Must:
  Keep documentation behavior independent from syntax highlighting and validation diagnostics.
  Use the shared `SpecDDLineClassifier` line classification boundary.
  Provide documentation for known SpecDD section labels.
  Show documentation only when the hover offset is within a section label range.
  Return no documentation for section values, body text, comments, tasks, scenario steps, key-value lines, and unknown labels.
  Register through IntelliJ plugin metadata using `documentationProvider`.
  Cover documentation behavior with Kotest BehaviorSpec tests.

Must not:
  Replace the minimal PSI parser with a full grammar only for documentation support.
  Define syntax highlighting colors.
  Report validation diagnostics.
  Add user-facing settings.
